      "statement": "`IdJagCredentialsExtractor` handles only Bearer tokens and maps a verified ID-JAG to `agent.webId`/`client.clientId`/`issuer.url`; the `PublicCredentialsExtractor` fallback in the same waterfall keeps anonymous `.sai/agents` discovery working.",
