      "id": "claim_79afc533a2f54a9c870e33de1d87e114",
      "statement": "The auth `.sai` verifier pins `typ` to `oauth-id-jag+jwt` before reading claims, accepts any audience URL under its base-URL prefix (same origin, normalized path), and trusts an issuer through `trustedIssuers` or the subject CID document before verifying the signature and temporal claims.",
